  "title": "Proposal to Revitalise the Ciliwung River through Bamboo Forests",
  "summary": "This C40 case study describes “Proposal to Revitalise the Ciliwung River through Bamboo Forests,” an urban initiative documented for Jakarta. It is included because it addresses river flood hazards, and it has evidence relevant to children's livelihoods, and it is located in the Global South. C40 describes the action this way: Ciliwung is one of the most important rivers that cross the city of Jakarta. Transformation will be done at the water banks…",
